cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TestLookup in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "TestLookup"
abstract: >-
  Self-hosted, offline-first test-result intelligence: collects results from
  test frameworks and CI systems, classifies and clusters failures, and turns
  the evidence into an auditable release recommendation (GO / CONDITIONAL_GO /
  NO_GO). Ships a web app, REST API, CLI, client SDKs and an MCP server.
authors:
  - name: "TestLookup Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/test-intelligence/testlookup"
url: "https://testlookup.app"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
keywords:
  - testing
  - test-results
  - test-failure-analysis
  - flaky-tests
  - release-gating
  - continuous-integration
  - quality-assurance
  - mcp
  - self-hosted
